, & (x,y)\\in R∖D \\\\ |x-y|, & (x,y)\\in D\\end{aligned}$\n\nIII. $\\{\\begin{aligned}|x-y|, & (x,y)\\in R\\cap D \\\\ 0, & (x,y)\\notin D\\end{aligned}$"] [#edb/ref 17592186152823 "Let $D$ be a finite region enclosed by the curve $y=1-{x}^{2}$ and the $x$-axis. If $R=[-2,2]\\times [-1,1],$ and\n\n$$\n{∬}_{D}(xy+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A={∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A,\n$$\n\nwhich of the following could be the definition of $f(x,y)?$\n- **I.** ${\\begin{aligned}xy+{y}^{2}, & (x,y)\\in D \\\\ 0, & (x,y)\\notin D\\end{aligned}$\n- **II.** ${\\begin{aligned}xy+{y}^{2}, & (x,y)\\in R \\\\ 0, & (x,y)\\notin R\\end{aligned}$\n- **III.** ${\\begin{aligned}xy+{y}^{2}, & (x,y)\\in D \\\\ 0, & (x,y)\\in R∖D\\end{aligned}$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked."] [#edb/ref 17592186152824 "Let $D$ be a finite region enclosed by the curve ${x}^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}=1.$ If \n\n$$\nf(x,y)=\\{\\begin{aligned}xy, & (x,y)\\in R\\cap D \\\\ 0, & (x,y)\\in R∖D\\end{aligned}\\,\\text{and}\\,{∬}_{D}xy\\,\\text{d}A={∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A,\n$$\n\nwhich of the following could be the definition of the rectangular domain $R?$\n\nI. $R=[-2,2]\\times [-1,1]$\n\nII. $R=[-1,1]\\times [-2,2]$\n\nIII. $R=[-2,2]\\times [-2,2]$\n\nSelect all that apply."] [#edb/ref 17592186152825 "Let $D$ be a finite region enclosed between the curves $y={x}^{2}-6$ and $y=2-{x}^{2}.$ If \n\n$$\nf(x,y)={\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}, & (x,y)\\in R\\cap D \\\\ 0, & (x,y)\\in R∖D,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \nwhich of the following statements are true?\n- **I.** ${∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A={∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A,\\,$ where $R=[-2,2]\\times [-6,6]$\n- **II.** ${∬}_{R}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A={∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A,\\,$ where $R=[-1,1]\\times [-6,6]$\n- **III.** ${∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A={∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A,\\,$ where $R=[-2,2]\\times [-2,2]$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked."] [#edb/ref 17592186152826 "![](images/d0/d0