}_{x\\to (-3)^{+}}g(x)={lim}_{x\\to (-3)^{-}}g(x)$\n- **II.** ${lim}_{x\\to (-3)}g(x)=g(-3)$\n- **III.** $g(x)$ has a removable discontinuity at $x=-3$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked."] [#edb/ref 17592186240971 "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of equations?\n\n$$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+3y &=7 \\\\ 2x &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186241007 "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-5 &=3y \\\\ 6+y &=4x\\end{aligned}\\right.$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186241123 "Consider the matrix $L$ and the vector $b,$ given by \n\n$$\nL=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $A=LU$ is the LU factorization of some $2\\times 2$ matrix $A,$ find the vector $y$ such that \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}Ly=b \\\\ Ux=y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nis equivalent to $Ax=b.$"] [#edb/ref 17592186241124 "Consider the matrix $L$ and the vector $b,$ given by \n\n$$\nL=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ -10 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ -36\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $A=LU$ is the LU factorization of some $2\\times 2$ matrix $A,$ find the vector $y$ such that \n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}Ly=b \\\\ Ux=y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nis equivalent to $Ax=b.$"] [#edb/ref 17592186241143 "Consider the matrix $L$ and the vector $b,$ given by \n\n$$\nL=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $A=LU$ is the LU factorization of some $3\\times 3$ matrix $A,$ find the vector $y$ such that\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}Ly=b \\\\ Ux=y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nis equivalent to $Ax=b.$"] [#edb/ref 17592186241144 "Consider the matrix $L$ and the vector $b,$ given by \n\n$$\nL=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 9 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $A=LU$ is the LU factorization of some $3\\